OL,3,GNEWSAJeremy Clarkson choir shows
OL,4,Afarmers they are not alone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA choir launched by TV presenter Jeremy
OL,7,FClarkson has highlighted the value of
OL,8,Fconnection in farming.
OL,10,FThe Hawkstone Farmers' Choir, first put
OL,11,Ftogether to advertise the Oxfordshire
OL,12,Fcelebrity-farmer's beer, won Britain's
OL,13,FGot Talent this year and has just
OL,14,Freleased its first single.
OL,16,FIts members, who farm everywhere from
OL,17,FCambridgeshire to Northumberland, say
OL,18,Fsinging together has helped them cope
OL,19,Fwith the isolation the job can bring.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
