OL,3,GNEWSAJeremy Clarkson choir shows
OL,4,Afarmers they are not alone
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on BBC Breakfast ahead of a
OL,7,Flive performance, Andy Owens, who farms
OL,8,Fnear Hereford, said farmers "normally
OL,9,Fonly get together at farm sales,
OL,10,Fmarkets or funerals", but the choir
OL,11,Fshared a "unique bond".
